      "message": "[error] Line 166: 🔴 **Startup gate has a race window.** `backupGeneration` is captured, then `canStartRuntime()` is checked inside the executor right before `daemon.startDaemon()`, but backup can still become active between that check and the actual start call (TOCTOU). That breaks the stated guarantee that restore/backup gates runtime startup. Use a shared lock/critical section between `JamiBackupAgent` state transitions and daemon-start decision+start, or re-check under the same synchronized block immediately before starting the daemon.",
